Fabrikam, Inc. adds the following MCP server to the repository MCP configuration for Copilot cloud agent:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "inventory": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["@fabrikam/inventory-mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

The configuration is rejected because a required key is missing.

Which key should you add?

Tailspin Toys wants Copilot cloud agent to read exceptions from a hosted Sentry instance at https://tailspin.sentry.io. The Sentry access token is stored as an Agents secret named COPILOT_MCP_SENTRY_ACCESS_TOKEN.

How should you complete the repository MCP configuration? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "sentry": {
      "type": [[1]],
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["@sentry/mcp-server@latest", "--host=$SENTRY_HOST"],
      "tools": ["*"],
      "env": {
        "SENTRY_HOST": "https://tailspin.sentry.io",
        "SENTRY_ACCESS_TOKEN": [[2]]
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Tailspin Toys writes an enterprise managed-settings.json file. Users must be able to run any GitHub MCP server that is hosted at api.githubcopilot.com. The filesystem MCP server must always be blocked when it is configured to access the root of the file system.

How should you complete the file? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.

```json
{
  "allowedMcpServers": [
    [[1]]
  ],
  [[2]]: [
    { "serverCommand": ["npx", "-y", "@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem", "/"] }
  ]
}
```

Woodgrove Bank deploys the following enterprise managed-settings.json file:

```json
{
  "allowedMcpServers": [
    { "serverUrl": "https://api.githubcopilot.com/*" },
    { "serverCommand": ["npx", "@playwright/mcp@latest"] }
  ],
  "deniedMcpServers": [
    { "serverUrl": "https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/x/actions" }
  ]
}
```

The file is valid JSON, and no other managed settings apply.

Which three MCP servers should you expect Copilot clients to block? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.

NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.
